  "document": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Welcome to the Tunic Language Tool (TLT)!" }]
      },
      { "type": "paragraph" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "This is a new document." }] },
      { "type": "paragraph" },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Here are some things to try!" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "- Click the Outer and Inner Runes on the left to construct a Tunic language character"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "- Click in this document where you want to insert the Tunic character and click the \"insert\" button on the left to add it to the document"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "- Observe the question marks underneath your Tunic character in the doc; this is the translation text.  Mousing over translation text shows you which Rune it is related to."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "- Click directly on the lines in the Tunic character editor on the lower left of the app; only valid characters can be inserted"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "- Enter text into the textboxes for the runes and observe how the translation of them in your document updates immediately"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "- Select parts of this document including Tunic characters by holding Shift while using the arrow keys (this is easier to control than the selecting via the mouse)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "- Use cut / copy / paste your selections" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "- Use ctrl-Z or command-Z to undo edits" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "- Use the new / open / save buttons at the top to download your docs and re-open them.  These files include your translation guesses as well as the document contents. "
          }
        ]
      },
      { "type": "paragraph" },
      { "type": "paragraph" },
      { "type": "paragraph" },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Here are some random (meaningless) Tunic characters as an example:"
